[[File:Relic slot.png|Relic slot icon|24px|link=]] [[Relic]]s are a category of [[equipment]], available at level 60.<ref>[https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/combat-in-guild-wars-2-secrets-of-the-obscure/ Combat in Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure], Guildwars2.com</ref> They provide special passive abilities and effects to the [[character]], some of which used to be provided by sixth-tier [[rune]] bonuses.

== Acquisition ==
;PvE and WvW
* Core relics are available through [[crafting]] and the [[trading post]].
** Recipes are available for purchase from [[Master Armorsmith]]s, [[Master Leatherworker]]s and [[Master Tailor]]s.
* Expansion relics are available through [[collections]], [[Instance|instanced content]] like [[Fractals of the Mists]] and [[Strike Mission]]s, [[reward track]]s, [[achievement]]s, story progression and more.
** Expansion relics are unlocked account-wide and can be purchased from [[Junior Archivist]] and [[Archivist Ikur]] as well as the [[Heroics Notary]] in [[World versus World]].

;PvP
* All relics are automatically unlocked and are available for use through the [[PvP Build]] panel, part of [[Equipment]] within the [[Hero panel]].
** [[Relic of Mercy]] and [[Relic of the Cavalier]] are unavailable.
** Relics that summon companions such as [[Relic of the Golemancer]], [[Relic of the Privateer]], [[Relic of the Lich]], and [[Relic of the Ogre]] are unavailable.

== Used in ==
{{recipe list}}

== Availability ==	
* Additional relics are added over time.<ref name="New Equipment">[https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/relics-bring-new-equipment-to-guild-wars-2-secrets-of-the-obscure/ Relics Bring New Equipment to Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure], Guildwars2.com</ref>

;[[Guild Wars 2|Core]]
* 40 core relics at launch, available for all players: [[Relics—Core Set 1]]
* 12 additional core relics released with ''[[Guild Wars 2: Janthir Wilds]]'' — [[Repentance]]: [[Relics—Core Set 2]]

;''[[Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure]]''
* 12 expansion relics upon release<ref name="New Equipment" />: [[Relics—Secrets of the Obscure Set 1]]
** The [[Relic of the Fractal]], [[Relic of the Unseen Invasion]], and [[Relic of the Wizard's Tower]] are also available with ''[[Janthir Wilds]]'', despite still requiring ''Secrets of the Obscure'' for the Legendary Relic.
* 6 additional expansion relics released with [[Through the Veil (release)|Through the Veil]]: [[Relics—Secrets of the Obscure Set 2]]
* 6 additional expansion relics released with [[The Midnight King]]: [[Relics—Secrets of the Obscure Set 3]]

;''[[Guild Wars 2: Janthir Wilds]]''
* 6 additional expansion relics upon release: [[Relics—Janthir Wilds Set 1]]
* 6 additional expansion relics released with [[Godspawn]]: [[Relics—Janthir Wilds Set 2]]
* 6 additional expansion relics released with [[Absolution]]: [[Relics—Janthir Wilds Set 3]]

;''[[Guild Wars 2: Visions of Eternity]]''
* 6 additional expansion relics upon release: [[Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 1]]
* 6 additional expansion relics released with [[Raids and Wardrobe]]: [[Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 2]]
** Earned through [[Raid#Quickplay mode|raid quickplay]], these are also available to core accounts, despite still requiring ''Visions of Eternity'' for the Legendary Relic.
* 6 additional expansion relics released with [[The Only Way]]: [[Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 3]]
* 6 additional expansion relics released with [[Code of Creation]]: [[Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 4]]

;Legendary
* The [[Legendary Relic]] was introduced in ''Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure'' as part of the second quarterly release, [[The Realm of Dreams]].<ref>[https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/the-realm-of-dreams-arrives-on-february-27/ "The Realm of Dreams" Arrives on February 27!], GuildWars2.com</ref> 
* Like other {{rarity|Legendary}} equipment, this item offers the convenience of freely swapping between different relic effects.<ref name="New Equipment"/>
* New relic effects for future expansions will need to be unlocked in order to be used in the legendary relic.<ref>[https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/legendary-relics-are-coming-soon/ Legendary Relics Are Coming Soon], Guildwars2.com</ref>

